# Generated run artifacts.
#
# `evidence/` and `results/` are produced by this project's own commands
# (`npm run eval`, `npm run test:integration`, `npm run demo`, `npm run probe:*`)
# and grow by tens of MB. Only the curated subset the documentation actually cites
# is committed, so a fresh clone is small but still backed by real evidence.
# tests/architecture/docs.test.ts enforces that the curated subset stays present.
evidence/*
!evidence/verification/
results/*
!results/batches/
